# Sveltia CMS backend repository.
#
# `cms/public/admin/config.yml` deliberately ships a placeholder. The workspace
# gateway uses the repository embedded by the build and refuses this placeholder.
#
# Leave unset for local development. Run npm run dev, open /admin/, choose
# Edit local checkout, then Work with Local Repository in Chromium and select
# the checkout root. This filesystem-only path needs no Cloudflare secrets
# and overrides remote endpoints even when CMS_REPO is set.
# Automated workspace tests exercise real handlers with mocked upstream GitHub.
# A test deployment needs its own canonical host, OAuth app, session secret,
# enabled runtime flag, and test repository. See the README cutover checklist.
#
# CMS_REPO=your-username/akscusa.org-frontend
